  "scientific_limits": {
    "en": "Original whole organism: small head, barrel trunk, crossbar-bearing dorsal sail. Not skeletal replica or renamed Dimetrodon. [\"Exact soft-tissue thickness over crossbars and membrane outline are unknown; boss relief is conservative stylization, not claimed exposed bone.\", \"Whole-body surface, posture and colour inferred from skeleton; no claim fossil colour.\", \"Exact specimen scale unverified; genus-size artistic target declared. Display contains restored bones, not all anatomy claimed original fossil.\"] {\"body_length_m\": 2.5, \"basis\": \"Artistic target within museum-published genus range approximately0.5–3.5m; not measured AMNH7003 or displayed specimen length.\"}",
    "zh": "原创低多边形研究；形态、尺度及不确定性严格以本次已核参考为界。原始限定：Original whole organism: small head, barrel trunk, crossbar-bearing dorsal sail. Not skeletal replica or renamed Dimetrodon. [\"Exact soft-tissue thickness over crossbars and membrane outline are unknown; boss relief is conservative stylization, not claimed exposed bone.\", \"Whole-body surface, posture and colour inferred from skeleton; no claim fossil colour.\", \"Exact specimen scale unverified; genus-size artistic target declared. Display contains restored bones, not all anatomy claimed original fossil.\"] {\"body_length_m\": 2.5, \"basis\": \"Artistic target within museum-published genus range approximately0.5–3.5m; not measured AMNH7003 or displayed specimen length.\"}"
  },
